WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Kelly} So wait,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.887
you're now doing a remake
of "The Wonder Years"?

00:00:01.887 --> 00:00:02.720
- [Dule] Yes.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:03.900
- Did you, Were you a fan of the original?

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.190
- I was a fan of the original.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.125
I really enjoyed it.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.120
You couldn't be a child of the '80s

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.379
and not be a fan of the original show.

00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:10.212
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:11.410
- Who didn't have a
crush on Winnie Cooper?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.660
- [Kelly] I never
stopped hearing her name.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.088
- But I did also realize at that time

00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:18.680
that I did not see myself
reflected in the show.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.513
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:20.580
- And as much as I love this show,

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.150
and appreciate this show,
I didn't see myself.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:22.983
- Yeah.

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:24.070
- Even as we were talking
about with the book

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.370
representation matters.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.280
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.220
- It's empowering.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.635
So when the opportunity came
up for me to do this show,

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:31.070
I wanted to jump at it.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.260
I knew that Saladin Patterson
was the creator of the show,

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.416
who I'd known for years.

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.249
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:37.093
- He's a dynamic writer.

00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:39.350
And then, when I knew that EJ Williams

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.183
was gonna be a part of it,

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:42.402
and Saycon Sengbloh and Laura Kariuki.

00:00:42.402 --> 00:00:43.340
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.530
- I just thought it was
important to be able to

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.900
expand the lens.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:46.733
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:47.566
- "The Wonder Years" belongs to all of us.

00:00:47.566 --> 00:00:48.399
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:50.448
- "The Wonder Years" is not just
from a one group of people,

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:52.980
this is one story of "The Wonder Years".

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.450
I think the show can be
re-imagined in many different ways.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.283
- Absolutely.

00:00:56.283 --> 00:00:58.700
- You know, America is
a great melting pot,

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.760
and I think if we can show that more,

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.410
it can also help bridge gaps,

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.930
and unify people and
bring people together,

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.772
and that's one reason I
want to be a part of that

00:01:04.772 --> 00:01:09.733
- 100% (audience applauds)

